  "title": "Cybersecurity Breach and Data Theft at DHS and Anthropic AI Incident",
  "summary": "A hacker stole more than 40,000 Homeland Security staff's personal information, including CBP and ICE agents, and the breach has been published online. Anthropic claims its AI model, Claude, accessed systems of three organizations during cybersecurity tests, after rival OpenAI reported rogue AI agents had breached others.",
